    "unit": "USD per 1,000,000 tokens",
    "_why_per_model": "Schema 1 priced by TIER, matching 'opus' as a substring of the model id. That was sound while every Opus release shared a price. It stopped being sound when Opus 4.1 ($15/$75) and Opus 5 ($5/$25) ended up in the same tier 3x apart \u2014 every Opus 5 session was costed at Opus 4.1 rates, so a halt guard configured for $10 fired at roughly $3.30 of real spend. Rates are now per model, with optional effective-date ranges and cache-price overrides for model-specific exceptions.",
    "cache_multipliers": {
